{"id":"n62261-1-3","stage":2,"title":"게다가 · 加上","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62261-1-3-1","ko":"네 가방 되게 예쁘다.","zh":"你的包真漂亮啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"가방","meaning":"包，背包，提包","explanation":"가방：包，背包，提包。","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18259","senseId":"1","lemma":"가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}},{"text":"되게","meaning":"很，极了","explanation":"되게：很，极了。","readings":[{"term":"되게","audio":"/audio/0cf800caa37043264b92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14902","senseId":"1","lemma":"되게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되게","audio":"/audio/0cf800caa37043264b92.mp3"}},{"text":"예쁘다.","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"6852b2954fc85566","term":"가방","zh":"包，背包，提包","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3","entryId":"18259","definition":"用来放入物品且可以手提或肩背的东西。","pronunciation":["가방"]},{"id":"0cf800caa3704326","term":"되게","zh":"很，极了","audio":"/audio/0cf800caa37043264b92.mp3","entryId":"14902","definition":"非常，十分。","pronunciation":["되ː게","뒈ː게"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3767be0ca70be04b629c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62261-1-3-2","ko":"그렇지? 게다가 가격도 싸니까 정말 마음에 들어.","zh":"对吧？而且价格还便宜，我真的很喜欢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇지?","meaning":"是呀，就是","explanation":"그렇지：是呀，就是。","readings":[{"term":"그렇지","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26031","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇지","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3"}},{"text":"게다가","meaning":"加上，外加","explanation":"게다가：加上，外加。","readings":[{"term":"게다가","audio":"/audio/619f5372a1e42afcadef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62261","senseId":"1","lemma":"게다가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게다가","audio":"/audio/619f5372a1e42afcadef.mp3"}},{"text":"가격도","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"가격：价格，价钱；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"가격","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62450","senseId":"1","lemma":"가격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가격도","audio":"/audio/c11b244773cd9b597524.mp3"}},{"text":"싸니까","meaning":"便宜，贱","explanation":"싸다：便宜，贱；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29718","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸니까","audio":"/audio/dd0195e5656c1fcef156.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"마음에","meaning":"心意，心思","explanation":"마음：心意，心思；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"4","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마음에","audio":"/audio/43f69e9e8e24ba2d0d8c.mp3"}},{"text":"들어.","meaning":"中意，称心，看中","explanation":"들다：中意，称心，看中；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"11","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어","audio":"/audio/079c88dfcd6e6363232f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"66da57bd505cc1e1","term":"그렇지","zh":"是呀，就是","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3","entryId":"26031","definition":"某个事实与自己所想的一致时，以感叹的语气所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러치"]},{"id":"619f5372a1e42afc","term":"게다가","zh":"加上，外加","audio":"/audio/619f5372a1e42afcadef.mp3","entryId":"62261","definition":"除此以外。","pronunciation":["게다가"]},{"id":"38c1b40757a204e5","term":"가격","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3","entryId":"62450","definition":"用钱表示的物品的价值。","pronunciation":["가격"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"便宜，贱","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"29718","definition":"价格低于一般价位。","pronunciation":["싸다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心意，心思","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"喜爱或关心的心情。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"中意，称心，看中","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"觉得某物好。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8b786d34f148942c7e7b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.402,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62261","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":77,"sequenceScore":2.1273,"quest